Economics at work: patients with Medicare are about to take the hit from CMS proposal to stop paying for E+M with modifier 25. 

Many practices stopped seeing patients with commercial plans on the same day as a procedure because of -25 modifier denials. 

 Medicare patients are about to experience the same “consequences” of having 3 separate appointments instead of one. 

